 "decision_why": "Take the anger meter, the gates, the 10 attack line and the reservoir pick, which give a readable per-enemy aggro state the engine can test; drop the global random rolls (use a seeded stream) and the per-call scan throttle (a few enemies per fight), and add MAX_ATTACKERS = 3 as a separate engine gate after attitude, since the donor has no cap.",
